{"mls":"R1696060","addr":"34 Park Street","muni":"Sinclairville village","town":"Charlotte","county":"Chautauqua","zip":"14782","ll":[42.266854,-79.255685],"status":"Active","type":"Single Family","units":1,"beds":3,"baths":2,"sqft":1739.0,"year":1952,"lot":1.65,"dom":70,"price":194500,"orig":199000,"chg":"Price Change","tax":4129,"tax_mls":true,"hoa":null,"office":"Century 21 Turner Brokers","phone":"mark@c21turnerbrokers.com","hhp":false,"remarks":"Welcome to 34 Park Street in Sinclairville, New York!  This beautiful ranch home has 1739 square feet of living space, set on 1.65 acres of land with many recent updates.  Walking into the front door next to the large one car attached garage is a welcoming foyer with tile flooring.  A workout or potential workshop room is straight ahead with a doorway leading to a large concrete patio and a rolling backyard with a 30' x 40' shed off to the left.  Next to this room is a combo full bath with walk in shower and laundry room.  In  the hallway is an enclosure for the hot water tank, furnace and other mechanicals for easy access.  A doorway leads to a large open kitchen with cabinets, appliances, large windows which allow natural light to fill the room and a large area perfect for meal preparation and conversation gathering.  The large living room off the kitchen has wood flooring, a wood stove fireplace insert and a vaulted ceiling.  A stairway off the living room leads to a spacious loft, perfect for a sitting/reading room or an extra bedroom.  Each of the 3 bedrooms on the main floor have large closets and wood flooring.  The second full bath has large tile flooring along with a walk-in shower and large vanity.  The backyard has a lush green lawn, mature trees and space to roam along with blackberry bushes toward the rear of the property.  This village home is close to many area and outdoor activities for all to enjoy.  Check it out today!!","facts":[["Total rooms","9"],["Full baths","2"],["Half baths","0"],["Style","Ranch